<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daehan Flour seeks 24,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Daehan Flour seeks 24,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan Flour Mills Co Ltd invited tenders to buy 24,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT), traders said on Friday.</p>
</text>
